5480","kind":"announcement","title":"🎨🐠 Drawquarium Creative Event","summary":"It's time to get creative! 🫧 We're hosting a special Drawquarium Creative Event, and this is your chance to show off your artistic skills, win prizes and get your creations added to the game! During the Steam NEXT FEST the demo will still have plenty of features unlocked, so you can really give your submission extra love! After the event, the demo will be downgraded to a more \"demo like\" feature set. So now is the best time to give it a try and maybe even win something! 🐟 3 Categories to Get Cre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:11:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690994","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4045480-1844115010495016","game_id":"steam-4045480","kind":"announcement","title":"Drawquarium has changed a LOT since the demo in May 🐟","summary":"Hey everyone! 👋Back in May, I released the first demo of Drawquarium. Since then, I have been working on the game pretty much nonstop, and a lot has changed.From the beginning, my goal with Drawquarium has been to create something that helps you slow down and relax. Something you can interact with whenever you feel like it, while your aquarium continues living peacefully in the background. That is also why the Wallpaper Mode is such an important part of the game.But there is another side to this","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T14:34:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010495016","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4045480-1830163047262248","game_id":"steam-4045480","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Out Now","summary":"Hey Drawquarium Community 👋,Yesterday I had to share some disappointing news: the demo was delayed.Today, I’m very happy to say that the wait is over.The Drawquarium demo is out now on Steam.Thank you for sticking with me through the unexpected delay and for all the support in the meantime. I originally wanted the demo reveal to be a fun surprise, and I’m relieved that I can finally share that surprise properly.You can now jump in, draw your own fish and other aquarium inhabitants, unlock new de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-18T11:46:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047262248","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4045480-1830163047260868","game_id":"steam-4045480","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Delayed","summary":"Hey Drawquarium Community 👋, This was actually meant to be a surprise for almost 35,000 people who have wishlisted Drawquarium. I wanted to announce the demo today, on Friday, April 17, and simply share the good news with all of you. But sadly, things did not go as planned. My demo submission did not go through because one required image was missing, and right now I am still waiting to hear back from Valve support. So somehow, this surprise ended up turning into an apology instead. What makes th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T17:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047260868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4045480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:22:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4045480":"2026-10-26T11:22:56Z"},"notices":[],"